        <mxCell id="c162" value="&lt;i&gt;The tab Ex B.2 with the third query selected and run; the lines in the gaps are left out. The grid is wider than the window, so it is drawn twice, before and after scrolling right, with the name and job title repeated. One row for each of the 9 users, in the security table&#x27;s order. Outlined: CostCenterID (first pane) and OwnCostCenterID (second) agree in every row, and TerminationDate and Flag are empty in every row.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="870" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
